        "collapsible_tab_pxw7hB": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "BENEFITS",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Carefully curated with over 40+ ingredients, The Super Elixir™ provides a complete daily solution for your entire body — without the bitter greens taste.</p><p>The Super Elixir™ supports:</p><p>+ Energy production and vitality</p><p>+ Healthy digestive system function</p><p>+ Cognitive function</p><p>+ Healthy hair, skin and nails</p><p>+ Normal fat metabolism</p><p>+ Immune system function</p><p>+ Supports healthy nervous system function*</p><p><br/></p><p><em>*Mood is regulated by the nervous system via neurotransmitters like serotonin and dopamine.</em></p><p>Vegan | Non-GMO | Dairy free | Gluten free | No artificial colours | No added sugar</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_EUBWtt": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "HOW TO USE",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Directions: Using the WelleCo Hydrator Bottle, shake 10g or 2 teaspoons of The Super Elixir™ greens powder with 8.5 fl oz of water, coconut water or almond milk. Blitz into a smoothie for the smoothest consistency. We recommend you take each morning or during the day, not at bedtime.</p><p>Pregnancy & Nursing: We recommend speaking to your healthcare professional before use or commencing any new supplement routine during these times to ensure that this product is right for you.</p><p>If taking any medication or if you have a medical condition, please consult your healthcare professional before use.</p><p>Dietary Supplement. </p><p>Storage: Store below 77ºF in a cool, dry place away from sunlight. Keep out of reach of children. Always use a dry spoon when measuring and best consumed within 90 days of opening. Do not use if lid seal is missing or broken. </p><p>No added gluten, egg, dairy, lactose, soy, and nuts. No artificial flavours, colours, preservatives or sweeteners.  </p><p>Foundational WelleCo products (The Super Elixir, Nourishing Protein & Sleep Welle Tea) can be taken, and are encouraged to be consumed, alongside one another. Based on your individual needs the remaining Elixirs in our WelleCo range may be suitable to be taken alongside each other. Please reach out to our Customer Service Team for any support in your supplementary routine.</p><p>Please consult your Primary Healthcare Professional such as your GP, Naturopath or Nutritionist, if you are unsure, have any underlying health conditions or are on pharmaceutical medication, as they can advise on what’s right for you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_LTemfM": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "INGREDIANTS",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong>: Barley Grass (Hordeum vulgare) Powder, Wheatgrass (Triticum aestivum) Powder, Pineapple (Ananas comusus) Fruit Powder, Apple (Malus pumila) Fruit Powder, Chicory Root Fibre (Fructooligosaccharides), Alfalfa (Medicago sativa) Leaf Powder, Spinach (Spinacia oleracea) Leaf Powder, Goji Berry (Lycium barbarum) Fruit Extract (4:1), Psyllium Husk (Plantago ovata) Powder, L-Glutamine, Linseed (Linum usitatissimum) Extract (4:1), Carrot (Daucus carota) Powder, Gum Blend (Guar Gum, Gum Acacia, Xanthan Gum), Natural Flavours, Xylitol, Calcium Citrate, Lemon (Citrus limon) Fruit Powder, Lime (Citrus latifolia) Fruit Powder, Acai Berry (Euterpe oleracea) Fruit Powder, Pomegranate (Punica granatum) Fruit Powder, Spirulina (Spirulina platensis) Powder, Papaya (Carica papaya) Fruit Powder, Beetroot (Beta vulgaris) Powder, Broccoli (Brassica oleracea) Powder, Grape Seed (Vitis vinifera) Extract (4:1), Siberian Ginseng (Eleutherococcus senticosus) Root Extract (4:1), Kelp (Fucus vesiculosus) Whole Plant Extract (4:1), Milk Thistle (Silybum marianum) Extract (4:1), Magnesium Citrate, Zinc Gluconate, Dandelion (Taraxacum officinale) Extract (5:1), Maitake Mushroom (Grifola frondosa) Extract (4:1), Shiitake Mushroom (Lentinula edodes) Extract (4:1), Green Tea (Camellia sinensis) Extract (4:1), Turmeric Root (Curcuma longa) Extract (20:1), Aloe Vera Gel (Aloe barbadensis) Extract (200:1), Live Culture Blend (Lactobacillus acidophilus, Bifidobacterium bifidum, Bifidobacterium lactis, Bifidobacterium longum), Horsetail (Equisetum arvense) Extract (10:1), Biotin, Steviol Glycosides, Carotene Powder, Copper Gluconate, Pectin, Selenomethionine.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
