            "date": "20 hours ago",
            "title": "Feeling Healthy Inside & Out",
            "text": "I've been taking this daily for one month now and already ordered more... I've noticed an improvement in my energy, and when a family member in my household became ill, I remained healthy; my immune system seems to be functioning at an all-time high! Plus, my nails are stronger and I feel like I have a bit of a glow, too. I'm excited to see the long-term benefits -- more to come!"
